Description: Use an iPad as a second monitor over USB (needs a free HDMI/DisplayPort)
 Plug in your iPad, open the OpenDisplay app, and your desktop extends
 onto it. Tap, drag, scroll and right-click work on the iPad.
 .
 Requirement: your computer needs a free HDMI or DisplayPort socket with
 nothing plugged in. Works on X11 desktops (not Wayland), and not with
 NVIDIA's own driver.
 .
 For further details, check out https://github.com/cray2015/opendisplay-x11
